Package: vespa
Title: Mesh Transformations with the 'Vespa' 'VTK/CGAL' Library
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person("Christophe", "Regouby", role = c("aut", "cph", "cre"), email = "christophe.regouby@free.fr")
Description: Provides R wrappers for the 'Vespa' three-dimensional mesh filters
    (isotropic re-meshing, boolean operations, alpha wrapping, surface
    reconstruction, point set processing, as-rigid-as-possible deformation and
    more) via direct 'Rcpp' bindings to the 'Vespa' C++ 'VTK/CGAL' library.
    Also includes a fast reader for 'STL' and 'VTP' mesh files. The functions
    operate on 'mesh3d' objects and cover surface reconstruction, shape
    smoothing, subdivision, deformation, and signed distance field extraction.
    Algorithms rely on the Computational Geometry Algorithms Library (CGAL) and
    the Visualization Toolkit (VTK).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: C++17, VTK >= 9.4, CGAL >= 5.5, Ceres Solver >= 2.0,
    Eigen >= 3.2, Boost headers
